          "body": "While full database design is the developer's role, BAs must understand how data entities relate to one another (One-to-One, One-to-Many, Many-to-Many). Creating conceptual Entity Relationship Diagrams (ERDs) helps clarify business rules—for example, whether a customer can have multiple active accounts. Understanding these relationships ensures that gathered requirements do not contradict fundamental data constraints."
